Lichess puzzles
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Puzzle positions and ratings in stockfeet/data/puzzles.json are derived from the
Lichess open puzzle database / community puzzles (https://lichess.org/,
https://database.lichess.org/#puzzles).

Lichess puzzle data is free to reuse. Stockfeet converts each puzzle so the FEN
is the player-to-move position (after the opponent's setup move) and keeps the
official Lichess rating and themes.

Stockfeet is not affiliated with Lichess.
"Leela Chess Zero", "LCZero", and "lc0" are names of the upstream project.
"Stockfish" is unrelated; Stockfeet does not ship or claim Stockfish.
Stockfeet is an independent product name and is not affiliated with those projects.
